== Undocumented changes ==
* Fixed the bug where {{i|A Lump of Coal}} would cause the black ring from {{i|Athame}} or {{i|Maw Of The Void}} to only deal half of the damage that it was supposed to.
* [[Angelic Baby|Angelic Babies]] spawned from Isaac will now always appear in the bottom-center of the room. This fixes the bug where they could occasionally spawn inside of the player, causing unavoidable damage.

